Alan Guth and Min Chen. [MIT 8.07 course](https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/8-07-electromagnetism-ii-fall-2012/).

Complete the public lecture-note sequence, substantial problem sets and available examinations, then critique the solutions after independent attempts. This is an advanced undergraduate course, not a graduate qualification. It deepens statics, matter, time-dependent fields, waves, radiation, scattering and relativistic electrodynamics.

The official page identifies instructors, Fall 2012, undergraduate level, notes, assignments and examinations with solutions; checked on 29 October 2026. Assignment solutions are not uniformly available. Commercial readings in its bibliography remain separate from the free course materials. OCW uses CC BY-NC-SA with component exceptions. Reconstruct the work independently and state which course resources were actually consulted.

